   Summary
   -----------------------------------------------------------
   • All dynamic values are escaped (`Utils.escapeHTML`) before being concatenated.
   • Full HTML strings are passed through `DOMPurify.sanitize()` as a safety net.
   • The search bar updates the hash on each keystroke → `/search?term=…`.
   • `SearchResults` builds a live submenu with safe links for personnages,
     armes, armures and objets.
   • The router injects only sanitized HTML into `#content`.
   This eliminates the XSS risk while giving you a functional, live‑search
   experience that respects your existing architecture. Enjoy!

